{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu-e-p047e","title":"悌答渡江决战同死社稷","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-5e38cacc3a827961deb7","label":"裴注·襄阳记","text":"悌答渡江决战同死社稷","evidence":["santizhu-q-21e817c85d7c0e0452be"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0110","role":"答吴之将亡贤愚所知、宜渡江决战力争、败则同死社稷、坐待君臣俱降无死难者不亦辱乎","evidence":["santizhu-q-21e817c85d7c0e0452be"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-21e817c85d7c0e0452be"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-21e817c85d7c0e0452be","source_order":[48,47,629],"order":8914}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0110","name":"张悌","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-21e817c85d7c0e0452be","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-644eb57c9a126837f3a6","layer":"pei","quote":"吴之将亡，贤愚所知；非今日也！吾恐蜀兵来至此，众心必骇惧，不可复整。今宜渡江，可用决战力争：若其败丧，则同死社稷，无所复恨；若其克胜，则北敌奔走，兵势万倍，便当乘威南上，逆之中道，不忧不破也。若如子计，恐行散尽；相与坐待敌到，君臣俱降，无复一人死难者：不亦辱乎","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":549,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":629,"end":759,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
